# This repository publishes the tool and its documentation only.
# Everything else in the working directory stays local: earlier drafts,
# build output that embeds absolute paths from the build machine, virtual
# environments and editor noise.
#
# The rule is a whitelist — ignore everything, then re-include what ships.
# Adding a new file to the repository means adding a "!" line for it here.

*

!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!invisink.py
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
